          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're in @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Kaiju Stance].</p><hr /><p>Like a kaiju, you leave a trail of destruction in your wake. Your shattering earth attacks gain the razing trait. Whenever you succeed with a shattering earth attack while standing on the ground, the earth buckles under the force of the blow, and all the squares beneath you become difficult terrain.</p>\n<p>Whenever you critically succeed with a shattering earth attack against a creature standing on the ground in an area of difficult terrain, you pummel the creature into the earth; they become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Immobilized] until they succeed at an @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Escape] attempt against your class DC.</p>"
          },
